      hiwBBody = text : kit.body {
        width: 100%,
        contents: "Steps become three tabs across the top, the current one underlined in orange. The window gets nine columns, the largest of the four, and an orange pin sits on the exact control the feature is about. The rail beside it lists only this step's features, numbered to match the pin. Grouping is literal: one tab, its features, one window.",
